{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76771-the-god-machine-s-heaven","id":76771,"title":"The God-Machine's Heaven","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-21T18:54:16-08:00","id":76771,"title":"The God-Machine's Heaven","content":"Hi all,<br /> <br /> I don't know whether I missed it when reading the corebook, but I was wondering: what would the God-Machine's Heaven look like?<br /> If it is dealt with in the book (even in vague hints) can someone enlighten me to this information?<br /> If it ISN'T explored in the book, how would the other forumites portray the God-Machine's Heaven?<br /> <br /> TheArchitect","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/220-thearchitect","name":"TheArchitect","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T19:12:53-08:00","id":76793,"title":"","content":"This world. God is already in his Heaven, and all is right with the world.<br /> <br /> The God-Machine isn't a particularly numinous or otherworldly being. It may wreak havoc with timespace, and it may have tendrils into occult spaces and states such as Twilight, but it is mostly a thing of this world, and to the extent that a divine domain would exist, it would either be the sum total of the Facilities that lay bare the Machine's workings, or a metaphor for a world where the God-Machine's influence holds sway and its motives execute like clockwork. Since the God-Machine can be viewed as the occult force of the status quo and the general state of the world, the World of Darkness as it already is can be seen as its Heaven in a certain sense, or at least, fairly close to one. It can always get closer, which is a statement that ought to scan as ominous to the Unchained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T19:47:06-08:00","id":76808,"title":"","content":"I don't think of the God-Machine's Heaven as a place you can go to. There isn't some occult nook and cranny where you go in and the God-Machine is hanging out. That said, reference is made to Demons remembering what their existence was like before they Fell or were given their current form. I imagine this as their current minds understanding the unity they felt as unformed Essence and the perfect clarity of pre-Fall life.<br /> <br /> My Messenger/Integrator describes it as &quot;light, warmth, and a thousand perfect voices all singing in harmony,&quot; because he's a musician. I'm sure my Destroyer/Tempter sees it entirely differently.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T20:49:41-08:00","id":76836,"title":"","content":"A while ago, I ran into a discussion about the God-Machine and The Principle which suggested that the two were working in tandem to return the universe to an earlier pre-cataclysm state. Given that a number of supplements suggest a kind of cataclysm which rapidly and irrevocably ruined it for everyone. Unfortunately I've lost the link to that thread (but hopefully I've put enough here for a kind soul to know which thread I'm talking about! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) .<br /> <br /> Anyway, I think that the G-M's &quot;Heaven&quot; is an end goal to return the world to 'proper functioning.' That is to say, 'fix' the event(s) that made the world &quot;The World of Darkness&quot;... What we have now - the world we live in and the fathomless infinity in which the G-M and it's hidden servitors operate in - is the G-M's (and possibly the Principle's) best efforts to make things less terrible for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1930-rixx","name":"Rixx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1930_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T20:53:03-08:00","id":76838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rixx</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76771-the-god-machine-s-heaven?p=76836#post76836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately I've lost the link to that thread (but hopefully I've put enough here for a kind soul to know which thread I'm talking about! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) .</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/defaultfcdf.html?g=posts&amp;t=75664\" target=\"_blank\">My best guess.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T20:57:23-08:00","id":76840,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76771-the-god-machine-s-heaven?p=76838#post76838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/defaultfcdf.html?g=posts&amp;t=75664\" target=\"_blank\">My best guess.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Not quite it, but close! and a good one. Though, I think the one I'm thinking about was on these forums<br /> <br /> Thanks, Satchel","signature":"",